{
  "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
  "sourceName": "Saheeh International",
  "language": "en",
  "direction": "ltr",
  "surahNumber": 75,
  "entries": [
    {
      "verseKey": "75:1",
      "surahNumber": 75,
      "ayahNumber": 1,
      "text": "I swear by the Day of Resurrection",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "75:2",
      "surahNumber": 75,
      "ayahNumber": 2,
      "text": "And I swear by the reproaching soul [to the certainty of resurrection].",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "75:3",
      "surahNumber": 75,
      "ayahNumber": 3,
      "text": "Does man think that We will not assemble his bones?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "75:4",
      "surahNumber": 75,
      "ayahNumber": 4,
      "text": "Yes. [We are] Able [even] to proportion his fingertips.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "75:5",
      "surahNumber": 75,
      "ayahNumber": 5,
      "text": "But man desires to continue in sin.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "75:6",
      "surahNumber": 75,
      "ayahNumber": 6,
      "text": "He asks, \"When is the Day of Resurrection?\"",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "75:7",
      "surahNumber": 75,
      "ayahNumber": 7,
      "text": "So when vision is dazzled",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "75:8",
      "surahNumber": 75,
      "ayahNumber": 8,
      "text": "And the moon darkens",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "75:9",
      "surahNumber": 75,
      "ayahNumber": 9,
      "text": "And the sun and the moon are joined,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "75:10",
      "surahNumber": 75,
      "ayahNumber": 10,
      "text": "Man will say on that Day, \"Where is the [place of] escape?\"",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "75:11",
      "surahNumber": 75,
      "ayahNumber": 11,
      "text": "No! There is no refuge.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "75:12",
      "surahNumber": 75,
      "ayahNumber": 12,
      "text": "To your Lord, that Day, is the [place of] permanence.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "75:13",
      "surahNumber": 75,
      "ayahNumber": 13,
      "text": "Man will be informed that Day of what he sent ahead and kept back.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "75:14",
      "surahNumber": 75,
      "ayahNumber": 14,
      "text": "Rather, man, against himself, will be a witness,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "75:15",
      "surahNumber": 75,
      "ayahNumber": 15,
      "text": "Even if he presents his excuses.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "75:16",
      "surahNumber": 75,
      "ayahNumber": 16,
      "text": "Move not your tongue with it, [O Muḥammad], to hasten with it [i.e., recitation of the Qur’ān].",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "75:17",
      "surahNumber": 75,
      "ayahNumber": 17,
      "text": "Indeed, upon Us is its collection [in your heart] and [to make possible] its recitation.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "75:18",
      "surahNumber": 75,
      "ayahNumber": 18,
      "text": "So when We have recited it [through Gabriel], then follow its recitation.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "75:19",
      "surahNumber": 75,
      "ayahNumber": 19,
      "text": "Then upon Us is its clarification [to you].",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "75:20",
      "surahNumber": 75,
      "ayahNumber": 20,
      "text": "No! But you [i.e., mankind] love the immediate",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "75:21",
      "surahNumber": 75,
      "ayahNumber": 21,
      "text": "And leave [i.e., neglect] the Hereafter.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "75:22",
      "surahNumber": 75,
      "ayahNumber": 22,
      "text": "[Some] faces, that Day, will be radiant,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "75:23",
      "surahNumber": 75,
      "ayahNumber": 23,
      "text": "Looking at their Lord.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "75:24",
      "surahNumber": 75,
      "ayahNumber": 24,
      "text": "And [some] faces, that Day, will be contorted,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "75:25",
      "surahNumber": 75,
      "ayahNumber": 25,
      "text": "Expecting that there will be done to them [something] backbreaking.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "75:26",
      "surahNumber": 75,
      "ayahNumber": 26,
      "text": "No! When it [i.e., the soul] has reached the collar bones",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "75:27",
      "surahNumber": 75,
      "ayahNumber": 27,
      "text": "And it is said, \"Who will cure [him]?\"",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "75:28",
      "surahNumber": 75,
      "ayahNumber": 28,
      "text": "And he [i.e., the dying one] is certain that it is the [time of] separation",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "75:29",
      "surahNumber": 75,
      "ayahNumber": 29,
      "text": "And the leg is wound about the leg,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "75:30",
      "surahNumber": 75,
      "ayahNumber": 30,
      "text": "To your Lord, that Day, will be the procession.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "75:31",
      "surahNumber": 75,
      "ayahNumber": 31,
      "text": "And he [i.e., the disbeliever] had not believed, nor had he prayed.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "75:32",
      "surahNumber": 75,
      "ayahNumber": 32,
      "text": "But [instead], he denied and turned away.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "75:33",
      "surahNumber": 75,
      "ayahNumber": 33,
      "text": "And then he went to his people, swaggering [in pride].",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "75:34",
      "surahNumber": 75,
      "ayahNumber": 34,
      "text": "Woe to you, and woe!",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "75:35",
      "surahNumber": 75,
      "ayahNumber": 35,
      "text": "Then woe to you, and woe!",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "75:36",
      "surahNumber": 75,
      "ayahNumber": 36,
      "text": "Does man think that he will be left neglected?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "75:37",
      "surahNumber": 75,
      "ayahNumber": 37,
      "text": "Had he not been a sperm from semen emitted?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "75:38",
      "surahNumber": 75,
      "ayahNumber": 38,
      "text": "Then he was a clinging clot, and [Allāh] created [his form] and proportioned [him]",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "75:39",
      "surahNumber": 75,
      "ayahNumber": 39,
      "text": "And made of him two mates, the male and the female.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "75:40",
      "surahNumber": 75,
      "ayahNumber": 40,
      "text": "Is not that [Creator] Able to give life to the dead?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    }
  ]
}
